# 3 母线潮流算例 (标幺值, 牛顿-拉夫逊)
# B1: Slack 1.05∠0° | B2: PV 1.0, P=0.5 | B3: PQ P=-1.0, Q=-0.5
# 支路: 1-2, 1-3, 2-3 均为 R=0.01, X=0.1
# 用法: circuit_run_powerflow
# 验证: 收敛 <12 轮; 功率平衡 |Σgen+Σload-loss| < 1e-6; B3 电压 < 1.0
B1 slack   V=1.05
B2 pv      V=1.0  P=0.5
B3 pq      P=-1.0 Q=-0.5
BR1 1-2    R=0.01 X=0.1
BR2 1-3    R=0.01 X=0.1
BR3 2-3    R=0.01 X=0.1
